WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,690
Good Samaritan, please give me something to eat.

2
00:00:01,690 --> 00:00:03,130
We haven't had enough to eat in days

3
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:05,570
No. If you need supplies, go to the official rescue center.

4
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:06,530
Don't you understand?

5
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:08,730
There's nothing you want here, so come and harass me again

6
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:10,690
Don't blame my brain for not having eyes, little girl

7
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:11,850
Don't be so unkind

8
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:14,210
More than twenty of us can protect you all and make friends

9
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:16,410
From now on, it will be you two women who live together and take care of each other.

10
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,490
Guarding such a large floor

11
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:18,690
Why not join us

12
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:19,770
Everybody ignored them

13
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:21,530
And take this set of red idiots?

14
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:22,730
Shameless

15
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:23,890
Brothers, come together

16
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:26,930
I don't believe we can't cure them. Just rush in and the supplies will be ours.

17
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:28,210
Don't even think about running away, these two women

18
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:36,270
Now I know this door cannot be touched

19
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:37,950
Unfortunately it's too late

20
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:48,980
It seems that I came back late, isn't it?

21
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,980
We just need someone to help move the trash.

22
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,220
Those who came today are just ordinary refugees with little fighting ability.

23
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,060
Really encountered a well-trained criminal gang

24
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,140
It's not that easy to deal with them. They have guns.

25
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:58,780
Moreover, there are many people and many tasks, and the equipment is not bad either.

26
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:00,540
I don't take the initiative to cause trouble, but I'm not afraid of it either.
